@startuml automated-pipeline-tobe
title JD → hire — now wired end-to-end (moss = automated · coral = human gate · click a step for its modules, calls & tables)

actor "Recruiter" as rec

[JD authoring\nneed -> design draft] <<auto>> as jd
[JD -> structured Job\ningest + taxonomy] <<auto>> as ingest
[Candidate fan-out\nSourced -> AI-matched] <<auto>> as dist
[Candidate apply / CV upload] <<auto>> as apply
[Extract text + LLM fields] <<auto>> as extract
[Archetype route -> V2 profile\nprovenance · potential] <<auto>> as v2
[Match\nKO · score · reason] <<auto>> as match
[AI screening\nfairness-gated] <<auto>> as screen
[Decisions queue\nearly-career · low-confidence] <<gate>> as decide
[Outreach + interview invite\ndelivered via comms] <<auto>> as engage
[Interview\nAI voice screen -> scorecard] <<auto>> as interview
[Offer decision] <<gate>> as offer
[Deliver offer · capture\naccept / decline -> Hired] <<auto>> as close
[Onboarding handoff] <<auto>> as hire

[Scheduler / cron\ndrives time-based steps] <<auto>> as cron

rec --> jd
jd --> ingest
ingest --> dist
dist --> apply
apply --> extract
extract --> v2
v2 --> match
match --> screen
screen --> decide
decide --> engage
engage --> interview
interview --> offer
offer --> close
close --> hire
cron ..> screen : nightly pass
cron ..> decide : aging nudges
@enduml
